==Japanese==
{{ja-kanjitab|いた|yomi=kun|alt=甚い,イタい:particularly&#32;the&#32;"cringy"&#32;sense}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|ja|ojp|痛し|tr=itasi}},<ref name="ONCOJItai">{{R:jpx:ONCOJ|entry=ita-|number=L007010}}</ref><ref name="KDJ">{{R:Kokugo Dai Jiten}}</ref><ref name="DJR">{{R:ja:DJR}}</ref><ref name="DJS">{{R:ja:DJS}}</ref> from {{inh|ja|jpx-pro|*ita|t=painful}}. Might originally be an interjection; compare {{m+|en|ouch|w=1}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{ja-pron|いたい|acc=2|acc_ref=SMK2}}
{{ja-ojad}}

===Adjective===
{{ja-adj|infl=i|いたい}}

# [[painful]]
#: {{ja-usex|頭が'''痛い'''。|あたま が '''いたい'''。|I have a headache.}}
#: {{ja-usex|お腹が'''痛い'''。|おなか が '''いたい'''。|My stomach hurts.}}
#: {{ja-usex|痛っ！|いたっ！|Ow!}}
